---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-20 relative border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="space-y-2 mb-12 reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold tracking-wider">
        01 // <span class="lang-id">PROFIL & LATAR BELAKANG</span><span class="lang-en hidden">PROFILE & BACKGROUND</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        <span class="lang-id">Tentang Saya</span>
        <span class="lang-en hidden">About Me</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left: Professional Summary (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 reveal-on-scroll">
        
        <div class="card-minimal p-6 sm:p-7 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            <span class="lang-id">Sarjana Teknik Mesin & Praktisi Mekanik Industri</span>
            <span class="lang-en hidden">Mechanical Engineer & Industrial Maintenance Practitioner</span>
          </h3>
          
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <p class="lang-id">
              Saya adalah lulusan <strong>S1 Teknik Mesin Universitas Trunodjoyo Madura</strong> (IPK <strong>3,42/4.00</strong>). Saat ini saya bekerja sebagai <strong>Mekanik di Departemen Mekanik PT. Shou Fong Lastindo</strong> (pabrik manufaktur sepatu) terhitung sejak <strong>10 Oktober 2026</strong>.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-en hidden">
              I am a <strong>B.Eng. in Mechanical Engineering graduate from Universitas Trunodjoyo Madura</strong> (GPA <strong>3.42/4.00</strong>). Currently, I serve as a <strong>Mechanical Technician in the Mechanical Department at PT. Shou Fong Lastindo</strong> (shoe manufacturing plant) starting from <strong>October 10, 2026</strong>.
            </p>

            <p class="lang-id">
              Fokus penelitian tugas akhir saya adalah <strong>rekayasa material komposit sandwich berbasis serat alam</strong> sebagai panel konstruksi ringan. Keahlian ini mencakup perhitungan fraksi volume, pembuatan spesimen metode hand lay-up, serta pengujian mekanik & termal standar ASTM.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-en hidden">
              My capstone research centered on <strong>natural fiber-based sandwich composite materials</strong> for lightweight structural panels. This expertise encompasses fiber volume fraction calculation, hand lay-up specimen fabrication, and standard ASTM mechanical and thermal characterization.
            </p>

            <p class="lang-id">
              Di ranah industri, peran saya sebagai mekanik mencakup perawatan preventif (*preventive maintenance*), perbaikan mesin produksi (*corrective maintenance*), kalibrasi sistem pneumatik, dan penanganan cepat kendala teknis (*troubleshooting*) lini perakitan.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-en hidden">
              In industrial operations, my mechanic responsibilities include preventive maintenance, assembly machine repairs, pneumatic system calibrations, and rapid mechanical troubleshooting on production lines.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Academic Info Box -->
        <div class="card-minimal p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            <span class="lang-id">PENDIDIKAN FORMAL</span>
            <span class="lang-en hidden">FORMAL EDUCATION</span>
            <span>2022 - 2026</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              S1 Teknik Mesin — Universitas Trunodjoyo Madura
            </h4>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 pt-1">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">IPK: 3,42 / 4.00</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span class="lang-id">Fakultas Teknik</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Faculty of Engineering</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span class="lang-id">Peminatan: Rekayasa Material & Manufaktur</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Major: Materials & Manufacturing</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

